WEBVTT

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.210
There!

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:11.630
Got it!

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.930
I'm getting a nice tan.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.720
Fried Squid and Octopus
Marine House Shonan

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.560
Marine House Shonan?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.150
It sounded fancy from the name...

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:29.230
but it's nothing but a shack by the ocean!

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:31.740
Dammit, we've been had...

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:36.280
Hey, part-timers, two more orders of
squid and three more of yakimoro!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.490
Okay!

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.330
M-M-My swimsuit!

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.460
Hey! What are you doing, you moron?!

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.170
Crap...

00:00:48.170 --> 00:00:51.210
S-Sorry ma'am, he's new.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.920
Hey! Apologize you idiot! You wanna get fired?!

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.720
Don't get us fired! Bear with it, Eikichi!

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:04.380
SHONAN JUNAI GUMI!

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:04.380
4

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.190
I can't take this anymore.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:15.110
How about I do quit this shitty job?
Right after stuffing you full!

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.570
Feel the wrath of the squid!

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.370
O-Our Summer income...

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:23.620
What a weirdo...!

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.790
What's so funny? I'll kick your--

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.470
What is it?

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:46.270
Oh, I'm sorry! Are you his friend?
He was just acting so funny, so...

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:53.270
Th-Thong...

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:57.110
That's enough of your shit.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:01.160
Don't underestimate me, right, Ryuuji?

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:02.490
Uh? What's up?

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.080
Hey, Ryuuji! What happened to you?

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:10.500
Sorry for laughing at you, squid boy!

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:16.590
Whoa! What a sweet thong! That's one hot girl!

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:20.640
You are both fired, and you
can forget your paychecks!

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:23.430
Sounds like he hasn't had enough squid...

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.140
Hey, baby, wanna have some fun?

00:02:27.140 --> 00:02:29.350
It's okay, we'll give it to you.

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:30.650
Let me go!

00:02:30.730 --> 00:02:31.860
Wait!

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:33.520
Those bastards...

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:34.480
Huh?

00:02:36.690 --> 00:02:37.940
Come with us.

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.570
We'll have lots of fun, all four of us!

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:42.240
Stop!

00:02:42.450 --> 00:02:43.990
Don't make a fuss.

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:48.540
Hey! Hurry up and throw her in!

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.680
What happened?

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.650
A tattoo?

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:19.990
That woman...

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:24.870
Huh...!

00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:31.370
Kanagawa Strongest In Shonan History
Midnight Angels

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:33.630
What?! That sticker!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:34.740
Midnight Angels

00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:46.260
<i>A normal looking girl with that kind of tattoo...
and that was a Midnight Angels sticker!</i>

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:48.520
<i>Why would anyone still have one?</i>

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:02.110
Are you sure you weren't daydreaming?

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:07.370
She was definitely just an innocent high
school girl. No way she has a tattoo like that.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:08.660
I'm serious!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:11.910
I saw it, she has a hannya tattoo on her shoulder!

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:14.420
In Japanese Buddhism, the Hannya is often a representation of troubled feelings such as passion, jealousy and hate, capable of transforming a person.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:14.420
And she was riding a black Eliminator.

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:18.960
You were probably so lost in her
thong that you started seeing things.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.420
It was no hallucination!

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:24.220
Also, there was a Midnight
Angels sticker on her Eliminator.

00:04:24.220 --> 00:04:25.470
Midnight Angels?

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.220
Yeah, I'd know that sticker anywhere.

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:28.720
Onizuka-san.

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:31.310
I've actually seen her too.

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:35.230
At first I couldn't believe my eyes.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.150
Then that means...

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.110
Outta the way!

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:47.570
<i>Attention! Halt your violence and
reckless driving immediately!</i>

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:49.950
Shut up, you dumbass!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:54.000
Don't you have nothing better
to do this time of night?

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:58.920
<i>Hey! Didn't you hear me? I'm
gonna arrest the whole lot of you!</i>

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:07.680
Showed you pigs who the kings of the night are!

00:05:13.560 --> 00:05:16.100
Hey! Let's catch up with the boss.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:22.320
What the...?

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:23.740
What is it?

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.900
There's a bike behind us.

00:05:26.950 --> 00:05:28.370
Hey, what do you see?

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:30.000
RETURN
Kanagawa Strongest In Shonan History
Midnight Angels

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.290
That name...!

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:42.750
<i>There has been an incident.</i>

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.920
<i>I repeat, there has been an incident
believed to be the result of gang violence.</i>

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.840
I can't believe it!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:50.550
T-This is horrible!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.050
DIVINE PUNISHMENT

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.610
Hey, did you hear? It was in the newspaper.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:05.400
Yeah, yeah! The Idaten gang from Hiratsuka
totally had their asses handed to them.

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:05.560
Tsujidou Prefecture Senior High School

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.200
They really got messed up!

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.660
I wish I could have seen it!

00:06:08.660 --> 00:06:09.740
Idiot!

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:12.070
But who did that to them?

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.200
Well, it's just a rumor, but...

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.790
Huh? You wanna know about the Midnight Angels?

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:21.170
Yeah! I don't know anything about
them other than their name.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:23.380
I figured you'd know, Tsukai-san.

00:06:23.380 --> 00:06:25.670
Why are you asking?

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:27.920
Well, uh... I heard a rumor...

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:31.720
Well, I don't really know
all the details either, but...

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:37.100
Ten years ago there probably
wasn't a bigger gang in Shonan.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:43.050
The first leader was an awesome man named Masaki.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:46.900
And when he started the gang
it only had ten members.

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:51.700
Before you knew it, they swallowed up tons of high school gangs,

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:54.500
Strongest In Shonan History
Midnight Angels

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:54.910
And the gang swelled to an
incredible 400 members.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:58.330
Anyway, when the second
leader of the gang took over,

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.580
it became known as the strongest,
most violent gang in Shonan.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:06.460
They were known for their Saturday
gatherings when they'd all assemble at once,

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:12.430
and the roar of their bikes would echo for
over an hour next to crowds of onlookers.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.430
They were that huge?

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:19.560
But it got too big and soon it split up
into two factions that fought each other.

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.980
That was know as the "Shonan Wars".

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.440
The leader of one side was the second
generation leader of the gang, Akutsu Junya.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:32.490
The leader of the other side was
Kamijima Toshio of the Inamurashibu.

00:07:33.070 --> 00:07:38.200
Their fearsome battles sunk
the city to the depths of hell.

00:07:45.000 --> 00:07:48.630
Then, Akutsu was arrested for attempting
to burn Kamijima to death,

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.650
and Kamijima ended up in
the hospital for a long time.

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.890
After that, the Onibaku defeated
the third generation leader,

00:07:57.890 --> 00:08:02.560
who was trying to bring the Midnight
Angels back, and the legend ended.

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:07.650
Anyway, the Midnight Angels
disbanded a long time ago.

00:08:07.860 --> 00:08:09.570
Huh? What's is it?

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:12.360
Didn't you see this morning's newspaper?

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:13.360
Huh?

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.370
It said a gang attacked the Idaten of Hiratsuka,

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:18.790
and hospitalized ten people.

00:08:18.910 --> 00:08:19.790
What?

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:28.340
I know someone in the gang, and he said
it was the Midnight Angels that did it.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.840
They were beaten by the Midnight Angels?

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.630
Really, Makoto?

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.720
<i>They're on the move.</i>

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:45.770
<i>With the Idaten gone, and with what Tsukai
said, they must be planning something.</i>

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.730
Umm, Danma-kun?

00:08:48.520 --> 00:08:49.730
It is you!

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.990
It was nice meeting you yesterday!

00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:57.910
You're Danma Ryuuji of the Onibaku, aren't you?

00:08:57.910 --> 00:08:59.580
H-How do you know that?

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:02.700
I ended up asking the manager of Marine House.

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:06.170
The guy who got into the fight with
him was Onizuka Eikichi, right?

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:09.000
He seemed funnier that the
rumors I heard about him.

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:09.900
<i>What? She's just a normal girl.</i>

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:12.850
I was surprised because
he didn't fit the rumors at all.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:14.590
<i>She's a totally different person from the woman riding that black Eliminator.</i>

00:09:15.010 --> 00:09:16.550
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:17.970
Oh? It's fine...

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:22.850
I'm Nagase Nagisa from the Fujisawa Girls School.

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:24.640
Na-Nagisa-chan?

00:09:24.850 --> 00:09:25.940
Nice to meet you.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:30.070
<i>She's really cute, and Fujisawa
is a rich girl's school.</i>

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:34.030
<i>Maybe Eikichi was right and I
mistook her for someone else.</i>

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:35.990
What's wrong?

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:40.030
Nagisa-chan, could I take a look at your back?

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.120
Please! Just a little!

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:44.330
Wh-What?!

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.920
It's really important that I see
your back just for a second!

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:50.040
W-Wait!

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:54.590
Nooo!!

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:58.680
It-It's not what you think!
There's a good reason!

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:01.430
What was I thinking?

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:05.480
I had no idea you were such an awful man!

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:08.020
Wait! There was a reason, I...

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.480
I blew it...

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:15.570
What are you talking about?

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.690
Obey the traffic laws
Campaign to stop violence

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.690
Fujisawa Police Department

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.950
Don't play dumb!!

00:10:16.950 --> 00:10:21.990
We have witnesses who saw you
fighting four guys at the train station!

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:25.500
I told you, I was just passing by at
the time and saw them fighting.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:30.920
If you want you can ask those four
if they were beaten by me or not.

00:10:31.130 --> 00:10:34.210
You haven't found them have you, detective?

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:36.760
Then there's nothing to talk about.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.130
You haven't changed a bit, Kamijima.

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:44.140
How about you settle down?
You're almost 19 now, you know.

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.770
What are you talking about, Matsushima-san?

00:10:46.770 --> 00:10:49.770
I have settled down since I got
released from the hospital.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.940
Have you healed up?

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:54.230
Completely...

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:56.900
Check it out.

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.370
Though the scars will never go away.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:11.540
It burns... it freaking burns!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:16.760
These scars! This body you burned!

00:11:18.590 --> 00:11:21.510
So, you've finally shown your ugly face? Awesome!

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:25.810
Come on, if I don't get to take you on soon, I'll snap!

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.600
C'mon, Akutsu!

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:36.900
Hey, have you ascertained the assailants in
last night's unusually violent gang war attack?

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:43.620
Huh? No clue. We've met with the victims
but all they do is shake their heads.

00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.870
All we have are rumors.

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:47.660
Rumors?

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:53.710
Well, they're just the rumors of kids, and
that gang disbanded a long time ago.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.710
The Midnight Angels, huh?

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:06.600
You're Onizuka of the Onibaku, right?

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:11.890
You're more of a ladies' man than I imagined.

00:12:12.020 --> 00:12:13.850
Who the hell are you?!

00:12:19.110 --> 00:12:23.990
This is quite an honor, being able to meet
a member of the famous Onibaku like this.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:30.950
Now that I've met you, here's a warning.
Your days ruling here are over.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.620
What do you mean?

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.580
You know what I mean...

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:39.170
You never destroyed the heart of the
third generation Midnight Angels.

00:12:39.340 --> 00:12:40.460
What?

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:45.720
You'll find out soon enough just what I mean.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:51.980
W-Wait!

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.270
You better keep one eye open while you sleep.

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.230
<i>That uniform...!</i>

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:10.620
<i>Yasha... who is that woman?</i>

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:16.580
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:21.460
<i>The girl named Nagisa and the tattooed
woman, are they actually different people?</i>

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:24.220
<i>I get a different vibe form each of them.</i>

00:13:28.800 --> 00:13:29.890
Good evening.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.390
Na-Nagisa-chan?

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:39.230
Hey, do you have a girlfriend, Ryuuji-kun?

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:40.070
What?

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:44.490
I've secretly been a fan of the Onibaku.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.030
R-Really?

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.740
It's just, all I hear are rumors
about how cool you are,

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:53.580
and I guess because you're so
free, or at least not so tied down...

00:13:53.830 --> 00:14:00.210
My parents are stern, and my school is
really strict too. I don't have any freedom.

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:04.510
So, I kinda admire people
who live by their own rules.

00:14:08.340 --> 00:14:13.970
Hey, Ryyuji-kun... do you think maybe
we could meet for a real date next time?

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:14.720
What?

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.950
I'll be waiting at Seaside Park
on Saturday night at 7pm.

00:14:17.950 --> 00:14:20.740
If you happen to feel like
meeting me, I'll be there...

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:27.450
Well, good night!

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.530
W-Wait! I didn't even say if I was coming...

00:14:36.160 --> 00:14:38.120
Saturday, huh?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.130
What? You've got a date with that woman?

00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.460
Yeah, she asked me out.

00:14:44.460 --> 00:14:49.800
She told me to come to Seaside Park
tonight at 7! Well, jealous are we?

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:54.560
What's wrong? Are you so jealous you can't speak?

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:57.180
Last night, that woman appeared.

00:14:57.640 --> 00:14:58.770
That woman?

00:14:58.980 --> 00:15:02.150
The one you saw with the tattoo on her shoulder.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:06.530
It was the woman we saw at the
beach, there's no mistaking it.

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.360
What are you talking about?
That was someone else.

00:15:10.530 --> 00:15:14.030
She doesn't have a tattoo and her name isn't Yasha.

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:17.000
She's just a normal girl named Nagase Nagisa.

00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.210
That woman brought up my past.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:25.250
And said she'd show herself as a member
of the Midnight Angels. This is a trap!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.130
It's obvious she's only inviting
you to your own funeral!

00:15:29.510 --> 00:15:34.050
Don't tell me you're so pissed I got asked
out that you're trying to get in our way.

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:34.970
Ryuuji!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:37.850
She's not like that! I know it!

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.810
I met here and I talked to her! Just look at her!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.810
That girl has nothing to do
with the Midnight Angels!

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:46.270
Don't even give me that shit!

00:15:46.780 --> 00:15:49.940
Bastard, you don't even
believe your own best friend?!

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:51.570
Shut up!!

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:56.200
I'll snap if I hear that shit one more
time, even if it comes from you!

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:57.700
Ryuuji...

00:15:59.790 --> 00:16:01.960
I wonder what I should wear...

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.340
It's a date, so jeans are out.

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:09.920
I wonder which one Ryuuji-kun would like.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:17.510
Hmm... huh? What's this?

00:16:25.110 --> 00:16:27.520
B-Blood...!

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:34.910
<i>NOOOOOO!!</i>

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:43.710
<i>Let's go, Yasha.</i>

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:50.340
No. I'm... Nagisa.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:53.430
I'm... I'm...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.780
Tsujidou Seaside Park

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.020
I'm such a loser...

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:05.690
I got all excited and ended up here early.

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.610
I wonder if you'll really come, Nagisa-chan.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.150
I'm no good with women.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.610
Sorry I'm late.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.530
N-Na-Nagisa-chan!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:16.320
<i>You did come!</i>

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:20.330
Well, I got here early, and I
was like, what am I gonna do...

00:17:20.330 --> 00:17:23.710
so I'm like totally surprised you came early too.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.580
I wanted to see you as soon as possible.

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:28.250
Nagisa-chan?

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.010
Watch out!

00:17:37.590 --> 00:17:43.000
<i>Ryuuji, I know you won't like
it, but I just can't accept this!</i>

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.910
<i>I know that woman has something up her sleeve.</i>

00:17:47.450 --> 00:17:50.860
<i>So, for your sake I'm gonna make certain of it with my own eyes.</i>

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:02.950
Er, uh... just standing around here
talking doesn't set the mood.

00:18:02.950 --> 00:18:05.370
I rode a bike here, so why don't we go for a ride--

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.830
Hey, Ryuuji-kun.

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:07.580
Eh?

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:11.000
There's something I want you to see.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.960
Something you want me to see?

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:18.010
Yes, something you wanted to
see really badly. You wanna see?

00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:18.890
Huh?

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:26.480
<i>W-Whoa! She couldn't mean
that she wants to show me her--</i>

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:29.850
Y-You've gotta be kidding, you mean right here?!

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:32.580
This is so sudden...

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:33.980
No need to hold back.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:35.610
B-B-But...

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:37.900
You said you wanted to see it, didn't you?

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:39.910
D-Did I?

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:44.240
Take a good look at who I really am.

00:18:44.450 --> 00:18:44.950
Huh?

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.540
Dieeeee!! Danma Ryuuji!!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:56.880
W-What is it?

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:58.300
My head...

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:00.680
W-What's going on? What kind of joke is this?

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.350
Run! Get away from me!

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.510
Nagisa-chan!

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:09.190
Hurry! You're in danger! I might try to...

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.240
What do you want?!

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.080
Are you okay, Nagisa-chan?

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:30.000
<i>The tattoo... then this woman is...</i>

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.630
You're a foolish man.

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:42.470
Sorry, but the true form of the woman
you've been drooling over is me, Yasha.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.270
She's Yasha?

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:55.320
Well, let's get started. You'll be a living
witness to this memorable moment.

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:02.110
You're Danma Ryuuji of the Onibaku who
took out the third generation Midnight Angels.

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.700
What happens this Saturday night
will be written in scars on your body.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:09.910
At the formation ceremony
of Akutsu's Midnight Angels.

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:10.960
What?!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:17.700
Fujisawa Police Department

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:17.700
Obey the traffic laws
Campaign to stop violence

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:17.990
<i>I've spotted a violent fight taking place
near Seaside Park, Requesting backup.</i>

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:22.660
Juvenile #2

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:19.460
Are you serious?!

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:25.470
Yes! Car 8 reported that the gang name
was confirmed as the Midnight Angels.

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.430
It can't be. Have they returned?

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.810
Don't tell me that Akutsu...

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:38.530
Wait! You can't get away!

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.490
Not from me!

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:55.500
What?!

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.260
Dammit! Of all the crazy...

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:10.930
You just don't give up!

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.680
Do you want me that bad?

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:13.850
Dammit!

00:21:23.610 --> 00:21:27.700
So long! You can dream about the
girl you fell for on the other side.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.700
Don't count on it, bitch!

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:54.480
What did you say?!

00:21:55.310 --> 00:22:00.730
Uh... yeah, last night there was a
gang fight around Seaside Park, and...

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:03.400
And they're saying that it was the Midnight Angels, right?

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:05.200
T-That's right...!

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:12.740
I see, so that bastard finally made his
move. Just what I've been waiting for, Akutsu!

00:22:13.130 --> 00:22:16.010
Sougou Hospital

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:19.420
So good...

00:22:20.210 --> 00:22:23.920
I feel bad getting all this from you guys.

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:29.680
Look, you were thrown off a
bike going 120 freaking km/h!

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:31.810
How can you be so damn healthy?!

00:22:32.470 --> 00:22:35.480
I'm injured, just look at my sprained fingers.

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:38.350
That's not even an injury!

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:41.520
Damn, you had me worried.

00:22:41.520 --> 00:22:43.020
I'm sorry, I'm sorry...

00:22:43.530 --> 00:22:48.490
Anyway, I'm not gonna let that woman
get away with this. Next time I see her...

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:49.530
Hello!

00:22:50.450 --> 00:22:53.830
I heard Ryuuji-kun had been
hospitalized, so I came.

00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.200
Her...!

00:22:57.200 --> 00:22:59.100
So hot!!

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:01.460
Ryuuji-kun, are you okay?

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:04.170
Bitch!

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:05.340
Onizuka-san!

00:23:05.340 --> 00:23:08.750
Are you here to laugh at Ryuuji?!

00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:10.640
Calm down, Onizuka-san!

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:12.010
What's wrong with you?

00:23:12.010 --> 00:23:15.560
This woman almost had Ryuuji killed!

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.680
Onizuka-san!

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.440
So, it was my fault...

00:23:23.650 --> 00:23:24.820
Stop right there!

00:23:24.820 --> 00:23:26.400
It's not what you think, Onizuka-san...

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:27.490
What?!

00:23:27.780 --> 00:23:31.070
She's not the woman who attacked Ryuuji-san!

00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:31.820
Huh?

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:37.330
Ever since two years ago, there
have been two women inside her.

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:42.630
Like an angel and a devil.

00:23:42.920 --> 00:23:46.630
She has what they call a split personality.

00:23:49.220 --> 00:23:53.090
My friend fell head over heels for her like a fool.

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:52.650
Fool

00:23:53.300 --> 00:23:57.310
But it wasn't just him. She was the
center of attention for every guy in town.

00:23:57.470 --> 00:23:58.730
She was a idol.

00:23:59.770 --> 00:24:02.060
But a real creep was after her too.

00:24:02.060 --> 00:24:03.440
A real creep?

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:07.570
Yeah, the guy who took control of the
second generation Midnight Angels, Akutsu.

00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:11.200
The Akutsu they call the assassin?!

00:24:12.070 --> 00:24:17.290
After she disappeared, my friend
started searching for her like mad.

00:24:17.450 --> 00:24:21.790
But Akutsu had been keeping
her captive at his hideout.

00:24:22.870 --> 00:24:29.130
Akutsu and the rest of the leaders of the gang
did unspeakable things to her for two months.

00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:33.550
She was beaten until she
lacked the willpower to escape,

00:24:33.550 --> 00:24:38.970
and then tried to get herself killed,
but she only got more brutal beatings.

00:24:40.770 --> 00:24:47.230
My friend knew about it, and finally
found her, but it was too late to save her.

00:24:48.190 --> 00:24:49.280
<i>Nagisa-chan!</i>

00:24:57.830 --> 00:25:00.750
<i>L-Let's go home, Nagisa-chan. I'm here to save you.</i>

00:25:00.910 --> 00:25:02.910
<i>Save? Me?</i>

00:25:03.120 --> 00:25:04.540
<i>O-Of course!</i>

00:25:07.630 --> 00:25:08.590
<i>N-Nagisa-chan?</i>

00:25:09.420 --> 00:25:11.340
<i>Nagisa's dead!</i>

00:25:11.840 --> 00:25:15.140
<i>I'm Yasha, Akutsu Junya's woman!</i>

00:25:16.090 --> 00:25:21.310
Yasha is the personality she
created in order to protect herself.

00:25:21.730 --> 00:25:28.020
Her body and mind in tatters, the only thing
left that would save her was accepting Akutsu.

00:25:28.020 --> 00:25:30.280
That's horrible! It's too awful!!

00:25:30.650 --> 00:25:31.990
Nagisa...

00:25:35.860 --> 00:25:37.740
She's been sitting out in the rain.

00:25:38.320 --> 00:25:39.450
Ryuuji, don't go!

00:25:39.450 --> 00:25:41.120
And let her freeze?

00:25:41.120 --> 00:25:43.330
I can't just leave her to die there!

00:25:43.330 --> 00:25:48.040
You idiot! Don't you get it? Leave her in the gutter!

00:25:48.040 --> 00:25:49.340
Shut up!!

00:25:58.430 --> 00:25:59.640
Ryuuji-kun...

00:26:00.140 --> 00:26:03.600
Were you sitting here all this time in the rain?

00:26:03.600 --> 00:26:07.520
I just want to say I'm sorry...

00:26:07.690 --> 00:26:11.020
Are you stupid? What are you doing
out here without an umbrella?

00:26:11.480 --> 00:26:14.030
I know you'll laugh at me for this, but...

00:26:15.610 --> 00:26:18.660
They say I have multiple personalities.

00:26:19.530 --> 00:26:23.120
Sometimes when I wake up in the
morning, I'm covered in blood.

00:26:23.870 --> 00:26:26.000
And I don't even remember what happened.

00:26:27.710 --> 00:26:30.750
But, sometimes I'm out walking on the street,

00:26:30.750 --> 00:26:35.010
and people look at me with
fear in their eyes, and I know...

00:26:38.340 --> 00:26:39.340
I...

00:26:39.340 --> 00:26:40.640
Hey, what's wrong?!

00:26:41.100 --> 00:26:43.180
<i>She has a bad fever!</i>

00:26:43.430 --> 00:26:48.900
I don't want to bother you anymore,
Ryuuji-kun. Please don't worry about me.

00:26:49.350 --> 00:26:52.190
Don't be stupid! Let's get inside!

00:26:52.190 --> 00:26:53.400
I love you...

00:26:54.860 --> 00:26:57.200
I love you... Ryuuji-kun.

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.200
That's why...

00:27:02.660 --> 00:27:04.290
I-I...

00:27:10.710 --> 00:27:14.340
No! Stop! Don't come out!

00:27:14.590 --> 00:27:15.380
H-Hey!

00:27:15.510 --> 00:27:18.010
I don't want to hurt Ryuuji-kun anymore!

00:27:18.010 --> 00:27:20.640
NOOOO!!

00:27:21.220 --> 00:27:22.350
<i>Could she be...</i>

00:27:23.900 --> 00:27:25.000
DON'T!!

00:27:29.100 --> 00:27:31.980
You morons! You trying to get yourselves killed?!

00:27:41.610 --> 00:27:43.700
Please, Ryuuji-kun...

00:27:45.200 --> 00:27:46.620
Let me die...

00:27:52.670 --> 00:27:57.670
I'll save you. You have my word. I will save you!

00:28:06.010 --> 00:28:10.380
Yamagishi Motors

00:28:06.720 --> 00:28:10.440
Akutsu? There's no way he'd show his face.

00:28:10.850 --> 00:28:12.060
What? He came back?

00:28:12.060 --> 00:28:15.050
<i>We were attacked last night!</i>

00:28:15.150 --> 00:28:18.320
<i>The other leaders that stood against Akutsu
are being taken out one after another!</i>

00:28:18.320 --> 00:28:21.110
What?! Are you serious, Horaki?

00:28:21.110 --> 00:28:24.660
<i>He's looking for what he didn't
got during the Shonan Wars!</i>

00:28:25.530 --> 00:28:28.580
B-But Masaki-san gave that to...

00:28:28.580 --> 00:28:32.920
The leader of the third generation
Midnight Angels, Yamagishi Akira.

00:28:35.290 --> 00:28:37.050
A-Akutsu...!

00:28:38.090 --> 00:28:41.630
Aaaah! It hurts!!

00:28:42.630 --> 00:28:43.800
<i>What happened, Yamagishi?!</i>

00:28:43.800 --> 00:28:45.140
Save me!!

00:28:45.140 --> 00:28:47.810
<i>Is-Is it him? Did Akutsu--</i>

00:28:49.180 --> 00:28:51.890
So, it seems you know where it is.

00:28:51.730 --> 00:28:58.000
Strongest In Shonan History Midnight Angels #1 Leader Masaki Kyousuke

00:28:51.890 --> 00:28:58.360
The legendary symbol of the first leader
of the Midnight Angels, Masaki Kyousuke.

00:28:59.070 --> 00:29:02.240
I will get my answer, even if I
have to tear your mouth open!

00:29:02.240 --> 00:29:04.860
J-Just get me out from here!

00:29:05.820 --> 00:29:09.120
Ryuuji, it's better if you give it up.

00:29:09.120 --> 00:29:15.830
I know she's suffering, but getting rid
of Yasha means getting rid of Akutsu.

00:29:16.130 --> 00:29:21.380
I'm sorry, Eikichi, I can't forget
that look on Nagisa's face.

00:29:21.630 --> 00:29:25.050
That's why I don't want to lose her to Akutsu!

00:29:25.300 --> 00:29:29.140
You're one hopeless fool!
Just do whatever you want!

00:29:30.850 --> 00:29:34.230
Yoko-san, does Ryuuji-kun like curry rice?

00:29:34.390 --> 00:29:38.310
Yeah! Even when he was little he
was happy as long as he had it.

00:29:38.480 --> 00:29:40.110
Oh, really...!

00:29:40.940 --> 00:29:42.690
Thinking about challenging me?

00:29:44.990 --> 00:29:46.360
Sounds like he's home.

00:29:46.360 --> 00:29:47.870
Ryuuji-kun!

00:29:50.040 --> 00:29:51.410
Welcome home!

00:29:52.410 --> 00:29:53.870
Long time no see...

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:58.710
What is it, Nagisa-chan?

00:30:01.840 --> 00:30:03.130
Get away!

00:30:03.340 --> 00:30:05.840
I've been wanting to see you, Yasha.

00:30:08.180 --> 00:30:10.930
You can't run away from my side.

00:30:18.480 --> 00:30:20.320
Right, Yasha?

00:30:23.280 --> 00:30:24.440
I'm...

00:30:32.870 --> 00:30:34.200
You're too late.

00:30:34.330 --> 00:30:35.250
Who are you?!

00:30:35.370 --> 00:30:37.670
You'll figure it out soon enough.

00:30:38.670 --> 00:30:39.960
Na-Nagisa!

00:30:39.960 --> 00:30:44.270
You may be Danma Ryuuji of the
Onibaku, but Yasha is my woman.

00:30:44.320 --> 00:30:45.380
I'm taking her.

00:30:45.550 --> 00:30:47.590
Akutsu! You bastard!!

00:30:47.720 --> 00:30:54.970
Oh, yeah, and Masaki-san's jacket
is mine as well. I'll be taking that.

00:30:55.140 --> 00:30:57.020
Did you say Masaki-san's jacket?

00:30:57.020 --> 00:31:00.940
That was stolen behind my back!
The Onibaku ended up with it and I didn't.

00:31:01.310 --> 00:31:07.320
Well, shall we settle this? We'll have a fight
with the woman and the jacket riding on it.

00:31:07.530 --> 00:31:14.040
I'll be waiting for you tonight at Enoshima
gate! Don't run off on me, Danma.

00:31:18.160 --> 00:31:19.460
What the hell is this?!

00:31:19.710 --> 00:31:21.000
The Midnight Angels!

00:31:21.420 --> 00:31:23.090
Have they really come back?!

00:31:24.050 --> 00:31:28.130
<i>Attention! Gang members, disperse now!</i>

00:31:28.130 --> 00:31:29.300
Stop them!

00:31:29.300 --> 00:31:30.300
Right!

00:31:38.560 --> 00:31:41.600
Well, Junya, how does the new Midnight Angels feel?

00:31:41.730 --> 00:31:44.440
They're the best!!

00:31:46.070 --> 00:31:51.240
I'll teach the people in this town
once more that the legend ain't over!

00:31:52.120 --> 00:31:55.370
This is the first page of a new legend.

00:31:55.370 --> 00:32:00.580
No one can stop me now.
Not until I catch up with Masaki-san!

00:32:18.390 --> 00:32:21.900
Akutsu! Where are you? Show your face!

00:32:23.900 --> 00:32:26.570
I've come to fight you just as I promised!

00:32:26.570 --> 00:32:29.150
What? You wanna fight with Akutsu?

00:32:29.150 --> 00:32:35.450
Give me a break! I, Kamijima Toshio
will be the one to beat him up! Scram!

00:32:35.660 --> 00:32:37.830
Kamijima? That name's worth shit!

00:32:37.830 --> 00:32:43.000
Akutsu picked a fight with me! If you
don't get outta here I'll take you out too!

00:32:43.170 --> 00:32:48.380
You've got balls giving me lip like that!
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:32:48.590 --> 00:32:53.050
I'm Danma Ryuuji of the Onibaku!
Leave before you say something stupid.

00:32:53.430 --> 00:32:58.600
Onibaku's Danma? Interesting.
I'll take care of you first!

00:32:58.770 --> 00:33:02.480
I'm sick of your shit! I don't
know what I'm gonna do to you!

00:33:12.150 --> 00:33:17.740
Hey, hey! What's wrong?
Show me the Onibaku spirit!

00:33:19.910 --> 00:33:23.080
You shouldn't be talking. Show me what you got!

00:33:27.170 --> 00:33:30.010
Don't underestimate the Onibaku!

00:33:30.170 --> 00:33:31.840
S-Shut up...!

00:33:41.020 --> 00:33:42.980
Die, Danma!

00:33:55.570 --> 00:33:57.280
Akutsu!!

00:33:58.030 --> 00:34:00.540
So this is Masaki-san's jacket.

00:34:01.120 --> 00:34:02.620
We finally meet.

00:34:04.580 --> 00:34:07.790
You get it now? You didn't
have a chance from the start.

00:34:08.130 --> 00:34:14.130
Well, can I take the vest now, before
it's stained with your filthy blood?

00:34:16.470 --> 00:34:21.390
Then I'll give it to you. Take my vest!

00:34:18.950 --> 00:34:21.500
Midnight Angels

00:34:23.270 --> 00:34:26.940
What's wrong, Akutsu? You didn't mean this one?

00:34:29.810 --> 00:34:33.070
You've really got guts to try
and deceive someone like me.

00:34:33.230 --> 00:34:35.820
Yasha! I'll let you finish him off.

00:34:35.950 --> 00:34:36.860
What?!

00:34:37.820 --> 00:34:40.410
I'm your opponent now.

00:34:40.580 --> 00:34:44.160
Snap out of it, Nagisa! You're not Yasha!

00:34:48.540 --> 00:34:53.210
You just forced yourself to think that, Nagisa!

00:34:53.340 --> 00:34:54.880
You're a fool.

00:34:58.180 --> 00:35:03.560
I've had enough of you calling me Nagisa.
Don't call me that again. She's gone.

00:35:03.770 --> 00:35:06.560
No, she's not gone!

00:35:06.550 --> 00:35:09.000
Strongest In Shonan History
Midnight Angels

00:35:12.480 --> 00:35:13.610
Ryuuji...

00:35:14.440 --> 00:35:20.030
Nagisa! You don't really love
him at all. You gotta remember!

00:35:20.240 --> 00:35:22.120
Yasha, use this.

00:35:25.830 --> 00:35:30.170
I want to save you from
cowering in Akutsu's shadow!

00:35:34.300 --> 00:35:35.800
Wake up!

00:35:35.800 --> 00:35:37.860
Nagisa is dead!

00:35:38.000 --> 00:35:39.180
You are Nagisa!!

00:35:39.180 --> 00:35:41.010
You're my woman, aren't you?

00:35:41.180 --> 00:35:43.300
Die, Danma Ryuuji!

00:35:44.060 --> 00:35:45.180
Nagisa!

00:35:45.970 --> 00:35:46.930
<i>Stop!</i>

00:35:48.270 --> 00:35:50.770
<i>I can't let you hurt Ryuuji-kun any longer!</i>

00:35:51.770 --> 00:35:53.360
<i>I just can't!</i>

00:35:53.820 --> 00:35:56.360
Nagisa, move!

00:35:57.190 --> 00:36:00.410
Disappear and get out of my way, Nagisa!

00:36:00.570 --> 00:36:03.370
<i>I'm not going to let you control me anymore.</i>

00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:10.790
W-What happened?

00:36:12.080 --> 00:36:12.920
Ryuuji-kun...

00:36:13.920 --> 00:36:16.500
Run... hurry!

00:36:16.670 --> 00:36:18.210
Na-Nagisa...

00:36:18.590 --> 00:36:21.260
Hey, Nagisa, is it you? Hey!

00:36:21.470 --> 00:36:23.090
M-My head...

00:36:24.100 --> 00:36:26.640
I guess I'll just have to kill you myself then.

00:36:28.520 --> 00:36:29.930
Akutsu!

00:36:31.520 --> 00:36:34.520
<i>You idiot! Under my leadership
you should know this by now,</i>

00:36:34.520 --> 00:36:37.320
<i>but you can't make a turn when you're accelerating.</i>

00:36:37.570 --> 00:36:39.440
<i>You accelerate until the very moment you turn.</i>

00:36:39.440 --> 00:36:41.570
<i>Get scared for an instant and you've already lost!</i>

00:36:49.580 --> 00:36:54.250
<i>Listen Junya, you ride a motorcycle with your
technique, and you feel it with your heart.</i>

00:36:54.250 --> 00:36:57.550
<i>Maybe it's too early for you
to understand that after all.</i>

00:36:58.510 --> 00:37:00.050
<i>Will you be the second leader?</i>

00:37:00.220 --> 00:37:01.340
<i>You'd make me the leader?</i>

00:37:01.630 --> 00:37:08.310
<i>You idiot! Who told you to beat him half to
death?! Who said you could lose it like that?</i>

00:37:08.930 --> 00:37:12.810
<i>It's the same as racing. You have
opposition when you say you're the best.</i>

00:37:13.270 --> 00:37:17.980
<i>Listen to me, and listen good. We're not a gang.</i>

00:37:21.610 --> 00:37:23.780
<i>We're Shonan's street racers!</i>

00:37:24.240 --> 00:37:25.660
<i>Wait, Masaki-san!</i>

00:37:25.870 --> 00:37:30.080
<i>Junya, when you finally begin to truly
understand the Midnight Angels...</i>

00:37:30.700 --> 00:37:35.000
<i>When you understand racing,
come back. I'll be waiting.</i>

00:37:41.260 --> 00:37:44.630
Onizuka! I'm not going to lose to the likes of you!

00:37:45.930 --> 00:37:48.890
Don't act so cool!

00:37:50.270 --> 00:37:55.850
I have to put him to shame. That's
the only way to get you approval.

00:37:56.100 --> 00:38:02.490
Otherwise, you'll get farther away from me.
I'm going to be in the same league you were!

00:38:14.040 --> 00:38:16.620
I've done it! I've finally caught up!

00:38:22.880 --> 00:38:26.510
I don't get it... how can he accelerate at this speed?!

00:38:26.720 --> 00:38:29.850
No! I can't lose! Accelerate! Accelerate!

00:38:29.850 --> 00:38:31.850
N-No...!

00:38:41.820 --> 00:38:47.490
<i>Listen Junya, you always accelerate. If you
get scared and slow down, you lose it.</i>

00:38:51.240 --> 00:38:54.950
D-Dammit, this isn't over, Onizuka!

00:38:55.290 --> 00:38:58.920
It was the same, Akutsu.
I kept chasing after him too.

00:39:00.340 --> 00:39:05.220
But I couldn't catch up. He's a legend now.

00:39:07.300 --> 00:39:10.600
He died. Two years ago, on this corner.

00:39:12.470 --> 00:39:19.150
Even if you chase after him, no one can
overtake him now. Not that tail light.

00:39:20.400 --> 00:39:23.150
Died... that man?

00:39:23.480 --> 00:39:31.160
Masaki-san told me back then, "This ain't
what I wanted the Midnight Angels to be".

00:39:33.700 --> 00:39:37.330
Thats' crazy... that man could never die!

00:39:38.000 --> 00:39:41.130
LIAR!!

00:39:44.590 --> 00:39:47.300
Akutsu!!

00:39:58.770 --> 00:40:04.400
<i>Darkness. I see, I'm falling... to the depths of hell.</i>

00:40:04.900 --> 00:40:08.950
<i>Wh-What? Masaki-san? Masaki-san!</i>

00:40:09.110 --> 00:40:15.370
<i>I see, you've come for me, haven't you?
I wanted to see you again, Masaki-san.</i>

00:40:15.740 --> 00:40:20.040
<i>Take me with you again, into the wind...</i>

00:40:22.630 --> 00:40:24.000
Masaki...

00:40:24.250 --> 00:40:25.800
Have you woken up?

00:40:26.710 --> 00:40:31.090
You barely made it. To think that
you survived a fall from that cliff.

00:40:31.890 --> 00:40:35.350
You should be grateful to the
man who carried you here.

00:40:35.600 --> 00:40:36.510
Who?

00:40:37.020 --> 00:40:39.680
He left without giving his name,

00:40:39.680 --> 00:40:45.360
but the writing on his jacket said
"First Generation Masaki Kyousuke".

00:40:49.030 --> 00:40:52.360
<i>I see. It was his back...</i>

00:40:54.070 --> 00:40:56.530
Do you think it's really right to do this?

00:40:56.530 --> 00:40:58.750
Yeah, it's better this way.

00:40:58.910 --> 00:41:02.710
I kind of understand how Masaki-san felt...

00:41:04.040 --> 00:41:08.000
I just wanted to run wild in
this city like an immature brat.
